			I've been running SRE teams for five years, and this hiring thread is missing the point. The name 'Proof of Human' doesn't matter. What matters is whether they can define what a Member of Technical Staff actually does in measurable terms. Step 1: give candidates a real production incident and ask for a postmortem. Step 2: pull the Grafana dashboards, find the blast radius, identify the root cause. Step 3: propose a rollback or a fix with a clear rollback plan. That's the entire interview. I don't need a CAPTCHA or a philosophical essay on humanity. I need someone who can keep the service up when the pager fires at 3am.

